Recon tool for offensive enumeration

Enumerates:
    Web Directories
    DNS Subdomains
    vHosts
    Amazon S3 Buckets
    Google Cloud Storage
by using brute force, wordlists, and handling incoming responses

GoBuster exists between the recon and scanning phases

gobuster --help
    shows a help page for the gobuster tool

Example - enumerate a web directory:
gobuster dir -u "<websiteURL"> -w <wordlist> -t 64

dir mode:
    enumerate web directories and their files
    Will return status codes that will Immediately tell you what's accessible
Get more help:
    gobuster dir --help
Example Above^

You can do the same help command for any other mode:
    gobuster dns --help
